#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:724
#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:266
msgid "The Remix API is not available in this session, so these settings cannot be applied. Run nativeloader_status for details."
msgstr "本次遊戲中無法使用 Remix API，因此無法套用這些設定。請執行 nativeloader_status 以查看詳細資訊。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:728
#, c-format
msgid "On this map %s also sets the sky. It keeps its sky while Follow the map's sun is ticked and nothing here is changed; otherwise your settings here replace it."
msgstr "在此地圖上，天空也由 %s 設定。勾選「跟隨地圖的太陽」且未在這裡變更任何設定時，會保留其天空；否則會用這裡的設定取代它。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:730
msgid "Sky"
msgstr "天空"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:731
msgid "Physical sky"
msgstr "物理天空"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:732
msgid "The map's skybox"
msgstr "地圖內建的天空盒"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:733
msgid "The physical sky has a sun, clouds, stars and a moon, and lights the map from them."
msgstr "物理天空有太陽、雲、星星與月亮，並由它們照亮地圖。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:734
msgid "No horizon"
msgstr "無地平線"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:735
msgid "For maps that float in the sky or in space: below the horizon the sky goes on, with clouds, the stars and the moon, instead of the haze of a ground."
msgstr "適用於漂浮在空中或太空中的地圖：地平線以下不再是地面的薄霧，而是繼續延伸的天空，有雲、星星與月亮。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:736
msgid "Follow the map's sun"
msgstr "跟隨地圖的太陽"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:737
msgid "Puts the sun where the map's own sun is; on a map whose add-on sets its own sky, such as Modern House RTX, keeps that sky. Moving Time of day or Sun direction turns this off."
msgstr "將太陽放在地圖自身太陽的位置；如果地圖的附加元件（如 Modern House RTX）設定了自己的天空，則保留該天空。調整「時間」或「太陽方向」會關閉此項。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:738
msgid "Time of day"
msgstr "時間"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:742
#, c-format
msgid "Now %s"
msgstr "現在 %s"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:760
msgid "Sun direction"
msgstr "太陽方向"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:761
msgid "Turns the sun's path around the sky."
msgstr "讓太陽的運行軌跡繞著天空轉動。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:762
msgid "Time passes"
msgstr "時間流逝"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:763
msgid "Day length (min)"
msgstr "一天時長(分鐘)"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:764
msgid "Time passes is on by default. A whole day takes 20 real minutes; untick Time passes to stop the clock."
msgstr "預設開啟時間流逝。一天持續現實中的 20 分鐘；取消勾選「時間流逝」即可停止時鐘。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:765
msgid "Sky update interval (s)"
msgstr "天空更新間隔(秒)"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:766
msgid "How often the sun, moon, stars and weather move, in seconds: 0.02 is 50 times a second, 0 is every frame. A longer interval costs a little less frame time, but the sky moves in steps."
msgstr "太陽、月亮、星空和天氣的更新間隔，以秒為單位：0.02 表示每秒更新 50 次，0 表示每個畫格更新。較長的間隔能稍微減少每個畫格的運算時間，但天空的變化會顯得不連續。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:767
msgid "Season"
msgstr "季節"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:768
msgid "Moon"
msgstr "月亮"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:769
msgid "Eclipse"
msgstr "日月食"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:770
msgid "Eclipse progress"
msgstr "日月食進度"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:771
msgid "From first contact (0) to the middle (100): a lunar eclipse is total from 70, a solar one from 90. An eclipse sets the moon's phase, and the time if the sun is on the wrong side of the horizon for it."
msgstr "從初虧（0）到食甚（100）：月食從 70 起為全食，日食從 90 起為全食。選擇食會設定月相；若太陽在地平線的另一側，也會調整時間。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:772
msgid "Night sky"
msgstr "夜空"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:773
msgid "Night sky image: sharp stars, a galaxy and nebulae, turning with the time and the season."
msgstr "夜空影像：清晰的星星、銀河與星雲，隨時間與季節轉動。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:774
msgid "Weather"
msgstr "天氣"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:775
#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:275
#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:279
msgid "(leave to Remix)"
msgstr "（由 Remix 決定）"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:777
msgid "Clouds, haze, fog, rain and snow, from Remix's own weather presets."
msgstr "雲、薄霧、霧、雨與雪，來自 Remix 內建的天氣預設。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:778
msgid "Weather change (s)"
msgstr "天氣變換(秒)"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:779
msgid "How long a change of weather takes."
msgstr "天氣變化所需的時間。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:780
msgid "Reset the sky and weather"
msgstr "重設天空與天氣"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:786
#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/nativeloader_sky.lua:786
#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:22
#: nativeloader/lua/nativeloader/guide_pages.lua:108
msgid "Sky and weather"
msgstr "天空與天氣"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader.lua:219
#, c-format
msgid "RTX package %s was updated: restart Garry's Mod to use it"
msgstr "RTX 套件 %s 已更新：請重新啟動 Garry's Mod 以使用新版本"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader.lua:360
msgid "A loader update is available"
msgstr "載入器有新版本可用"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader.lua:378
#, c-format
msgid "You are running loader %s. The latest release is %s."
msgstr "你正在執行載入器 %s，最新發行版本為 %s。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader.lua:379
msgid "Download winmm.dll from the release page, replace bin\\win64\\winmm.dll in your game folder, then restart Garry's Mod. The Workshop package updates automatically; only this file needs a manual update."
msgstr "從發行頁面下載 winmm.dll，替換遊戲資料夾中的 bin\\win64\\winmm.dll，然後重新啟動 Garry's Mod。工作坊套件會自動更新，只有這個檔案需要手動更新。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader.lua:397
msgid "Open the download page"
msgstr "開啟下載頁面"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader.lua:398
msgid "Later"
msgstr "稍後提醒"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader.lua:399
#, c-format
msgid "Don't remind me about %s"
msgstr "不再提醒我更新至 %s"

