#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:225
#, c-format
msgid "Performance tier: %s (%s; %s, %s MiB VRAM). To change it, set remix.performance_tier in native-loader\\config.json to auto, high, medium or low, then restart Garry's Mod."
msgstr "效能等級：%s（%s；%s，%s MiB 顯示記憶體）。若要變更，請在 native-loader\\config.json 中將 remix.performance_tier 設為 auto、high、medium 或 low，然後重新啟動 Garry's Mod。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_menu.lua:226
